        "notes": "Inspected2009 west/south front: warm white Gothic church, triple pointed upper windows/doors in front gable, flanking slender pinnacles. Main tall spire is offset on south side of entrance, stepped square base with repeated pointed lancets, octagonal upper stage/circular fields, small corner spires and long faceted white needle/cross. Not a centered facade tower."
